  net: stmmac: selftests: Add tests for SA Insertion/Replacement
  net: stmmac: xgmac: Add EEE support
  net: stmmac: Add support for VLAN Insertion Offload
  net: stmmac: selftests: Add selftest for VLAN TX Offload

